            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked whether, without guidance on what \u201cusual and customary\u201d means, a respondent could be accused of having made false statements."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "703408db98d243c6baa82b8422d7dd82ca1d956ddd1aef8b987ecdced67803bf",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-703408db98d2-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 54,
              "start": 54
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Jackson asked whether the allegations about the respondents\u2019 subjective beliefs matter."
      }
    ],
